<title>USA: Brown &amp; Sharpe Q3 shr rises to $0.14.</title>
<headline>Brown &amp; Sharpe Q3 shr rises to $0.14.</headline>
<dateline>NORTH KINGSTOWN, R.I. 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr   profit    $0.14	  profit  $0.03</p>
<p> Net   profit    1,257	  profit  220</p>
<p> Sales profit    83,791	 profit  78,571</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  8,886		    8,779</p>
<p>	  Nine Months</p>
<p> Shr   profit    $0.41	  loss    $0.02</p>
<p> Net   profit    41	     loss    2</p>
<p> Sales profit    249,904	profit  236,920</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  8,885		    8,693</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Full company name is Brown &amp; Sharpe Manufacturing Co</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said third quarter 1996 earnings improved compared to the same period last year because of better gross margin and selling, general and administrative expenses as a percentage of sales.</p>
